<details class="analytics-settings"><summary>Website visit settings</summary>
<p>We use Umami to count visits to public information pages. Widgets, reservation forms, guest links, owner dashboards and sign-in pages are excluded. No account identity, form content or URL query is sent. Umami receives the network request and basic browser information. <a href="/Privacy">Privacy notice</a>.</p>
<label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="analytics-opt-out"/> Turn off public visit tracking in this browser</label>
<button type="button" class="secondary" id="analytics-save">Save visit preference</button><p id="analytics-status" role="status">JavaScript is required for tracking and these settings. Without it, tracking is off.</p>
</details>
